      "name": "[Blueprint][Yixuan] Gold Talisman of Mystic Feathers - Lv.50",
      "desc": "This blueprint can be used to unlock the crafting of Yixuan's exclusive Tactical Prism at the Smart Workshop. Obtained through investigations or purchased from Boojee's Store - Permanent Store - Blueprint Direct Sale.\nItem Effect: When triggering a Perfect Block, Yixuan immediately recovers 60 Adrenaline.\nWhile charging for EX Special Attack: Ink Manifestation, Perfect Block can be triggered, after which additionally restores 15 Technique Points and gains <color=#2BAD00>18% DMG boost</color> that lasts for 15s. Each Perfect Block against an enemy increases the next Ultimate <color=#2BAD00>DMG by an additional 20%</color>, stacking up to 3 times.",
